<article class="ltx_document ltx_fleqn">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
Adapting Speech Foundation Models with Large Language Models for Unified Speech Recognition</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_journal"><span class="ltx_note_name">Journal: </span>Pattern Recognition</span></span></span>
